<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1428"><title>Babel × Inferno — A Tower Above, Nine Circles Below</title><style>:root{font-family:system-ui;color:#f6ecd9;color-scheme:dark;background:#0b1428}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0,#384161,#0b1428 70%)}main{max-width:1050px;margin:auto;padding:16px}a{color:#e4c895}h1{font:700 clamp(2rem,7vw,4.1rem)/1.05 Georgia,serif;margin:14px 0}h2{margin:8px 0}p{color:#cfccdb;line-height:1.5}.hero,.panel{border:1px solid #967958;border-radius:17px;padding:19px;background:#172841;margin:14px 0}.hero{background:linear-gradient(110deg,#253d5d,#272038)}.kicker{color:#efd39c;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.77rem;letter-spacing:.14em}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}.tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:9px;max-width:380px;margin:15px auto}.tile{aspect-ratio:1;background:#725d4a;border:2px solid #d4a35e;border-radius:12px;color:#fff;font-size:1.7rem;cursor:pointer}.tile.restore{background:#247967}.tile.trap{background:#8d415b}.tile.empty{background:#4b6180}.tile:disabled{opacity:.83;cursor:default}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:6px}.stats div{background:#102237;border-radius:9px;text-align:center;padding:10px}.stats strong{font-size:1.4rem;display:block;color:#efd59e}.stats small{color:#cbcedd}.controls{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}button,.button,input{padding:11px;background:#324966;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #a89c86;color:white;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ffe0a6}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}.primary{background:#866039}.status{min-height:2em;color:#f8d9a2}canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:13px;background:#091731;aspect-ratio:1.3}.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px}.two button{font-size:.85rem}.note{border-left:4px solid #eac488;padding:10px;background:#343144;margin:12px 0;font-size:.88rem}.modulelist{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(205px,1fr));gap:9px}.modulelist button{text-align:left;font-size:.85rem}.modulelist small{display:block;color:#c9d1d7}.characters{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}.characters span{border:1px solid #d4a35e;padding:8px;border-radius:7px}.minor{font-size:.82rem;color:#c2c5d2}@media(max-width:760px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><main><nav class="controls"><a class="button" href="../index.html">← Factory</a><a class="button" href="./index.html">Universal Node</a><a class="button" href="../build-order/index.html">Master Build Plan</a></nav><header class="hero"><div class="kicker">Original game · Nathan Tabor · TABOR WORLD × TABOR INFINITUM</div><h1>THE TOWER OF BABEL<br><em>× DANTE'S INFERNO</em></h1><p>Nine levels above Earth, nine mirrored below. At the middle, a 360° rotating X marks the center of the Earth-fixed frame. In Dante's ninth circle, the deepest level is frozen. Restore empathy, truth, dignity, and compassion by dismantling harmful systems—not people.</p></header><div class="layout"><section class="panel"><div id="realm" class="kicker"></div><h2 id="title"></h2><p id="lesson"></p><div class="stats"><div><strong id="energy">7</strong><small>Energy</small></div><div><strong id="shields">2</strong><small>Shield</small></div><div><strong id="score">0</strong><small>Score</small></div></div><p id="level" class="minor"></p><div id="board" class="tiles" aria-label="Nine interactive puzzle stones"></div><p id="feedback" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="controls"><button id="advance" class="primary">Next Level →</button><button id="retry">Retry Floor</button><button id="reset">Start Over</button></div><p class="minor">Tap stones. Find all three ✦ restoration symbols. ⚡ obstacles consume shields first; ◇ discoveries earn points. Progress saves locally on your device.</p></section><section class="panel"><div class="kicker">Mother Earth · Core Origin · Rotating X</div><h2>The mirror in the middle</h2><canvas id="cosmos" width="680" height="520" aria-label="Animated conceptual rotating X at the Earth center with the tower above and inferno below"></canvas><p id="rotation" class="minor"></p><div class="two"><button data-mode="forward">Forward</button><button data-mode="backward">Backward</button><button data-mode="mirror">Mirror</button><button data-mode="upside_down">Upside Down</button><button data-mode="this_side_of_mirror">This Side</button><button data-mode="other_side_of_mirror">Other Side</button></div><div class="note">The center stays (0,0,0) within the Earth-centered coordinate frame. It is not a physically motionless center of the cosmos. The six views are interactive artistic transforms.</div></section></div><section class="panel"><h2>Scale the mirror: Body → Earth → Cosmos → Unknown</h2><p>Explore biological, planetary, and cosmic systems using the already-built TABOR Universal Node. These are learning analogies; no health diagnosis or invisible-entity detector is running.</p><div class="two"><button data-group="body">Human Body</button><button data-group="earth">Mother Earth</button><button data-group="cosmos">Cosmos</button><button data-group="unknown">Unseen & Unknown</button></div><div id="modules" class="modulelist" style="margin-top:12px"></div><p id="description" class="note">Choose any node to inspect its functionality and limits.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>444 = HHH · 555 = SSS · 000 = OOO</h2><p>Creative digit/letter equivalences are optional ciphers, not proven historical origins. Original literal text remains intact.</p><input id="cipherInput" aria-label="Type a code" value="444 555 000"><div id="boxes" class="characters" style="margin-top:10px"></div><p id="cipherResult" class="status"></p></section><footer class="minor">Original game inspired by Genesis 11 and Dante's literary Inferno. The nine-level Babel construction is fictional game design; gaslighting, pride and manipulation are thematic story elements, not medical diagnoses. The last frozen circle reflects Dante's poem, not a statement that physical hell has been measured.</footer></main><script src="./engine.js"></script><script src="./babel-game.js"></script><script src="../sovereign-boxes/engine.js"></script><script>
'use strict';const $=id=>document.getElementById(id),G=BabelInfernoGame,U=TaborUniversalNode;let game=G.newGame(),node=U.make(73),mode='forward';try{const saved=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('tabor-babel-inferno-v1'));if(saved){G.validate(saved);game=saved}}catch(e){}function save(){try{localStorage.setItem('tabor-babel-inferno-v1',JSON.stringify(game))}catch(e){}}
function render(msg='Uncover the three restoration symbols.'){const stage=G.getStage(game);$('realm').textContent=stage.realm==='babel'?'ABOVE GROUND · BABEL':'BELOW GROUND · INFERNO';$('title').textContent=stage.title+(stage.frozen?' ❄ FROZEN NINTH CIRCLE':'');$('lesson').textContent=stage.lesson;$('level').textContent='Level '+(game.stageIndex+1)+' of 18 · '+stage.virtue+' · Restored '+game.restored+'/3';$('energy').textContent=game.health;$('shields').textContent=game.shield;$('score').textContent=game.score;const board=$('board');board.replaceChildren();for(const tile of game.tiles){const b=document.createElement('button');b.type='button';b.className='tile '+(tile.revealed?tile.kind:'');b.textContent=tile.revealed?({restore:'✦',trap:'⚡',empty:'◇'}[tile.kind]):'▧';b.disabled=tile.revealed||game.finished||game.restored===3||game.health===0;b.setAttribute('aria-label','Stone '+(tile.id+1)+(tile.revealed?' '+tile.kind:''));b.onclick=()=>{const x=G.action(game,tile.id);game=x.state;save();render(x.event==='victory'?'🏆 All 18 levels restored!':x.event==='stage-restored'?'Floor restored! Advance to the next.':x.event==='restoration'?'Restoration symbol secured!':x.event==='challenge'?'An obstacle cost 1 energy.':x.event==='shield-protected'?'Shield protected you.':'Discovery bonus!')};board.append(b)}$('advance').disabled=game.restored!==3||game.finished||game.health===0;$('feedback').textContent=game.health===0?'Energy exhausted. Retry this floor.':msg;}
$('advance').onclick=()=>{try{game=G.next(game);save();render()}catch(e){$('feedback').textContent=e.message}};$('retry').onclick=()=>{game=G.restartStage(game);save();render('Floor reset without losing prior progress.')};$('reset').onclick=()=>{if(confirm('Clear all quest progress?')){game=G.newGame();save();render()}};function drawModules(group){const out=$('modules');out.replaceChildren();for(const n of U.componentsFor(group)){const b=document.createElement('button');b.textContent=n.name;const sm=document.createElement('small');sm.textContent=n.model;b.append(sm);b.onclick=()=>$('description').textContent=n.name+': '+n.model+'. LIMIT: '+n.boundary;out.append(b)}}document.querySelectorAll('[data-group]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>drawModules(b.dataset.group));document.querySelectorAll('[data-mode]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{mode=b.dataset.mode;b.classList.toggle('primary');});function cipher(){const x=$('cipherInput').value,z=G.cipher(x),out=$('boxes');out.replaceChildren();SovereignBoxes.boxText(x).forEach(c=>{const s=document.createElement('span');s.textContent=c.value===' '?'␣':c.value;out.append(s)});$('cipherResult').textContent=z.digitToLetter+' | Mirror: '+z.reverse}$('cipherInput').oninput=cipher;
const canvas=$('cosmos'),ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');function draw(){const w=680,h=520,cx=w/2,cy=h/2;ctx.fillStyle='#07172c';ctx.fillRect(0,0,w,h);for(let i=0;i<58;i++){ctx.fillStyle=i%4?'#7dadd1':'#fcd7a0';ctx.globalAlpha=.3+i%4*.13;ctx.fillRect((i*127)%w,(i*79)%h,2,2)}ctx.globalAlpha=1;ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(cx,cy,74,0,7);ctx.fillStyle='#1d5375';ctx.fill();ctx.lineWidth=3;ctx.strokeStyle='#72cbd9';ctx.stroke();const m=U.rotationMatrix(...node.angles);function p(q){const a=U.multiply(m,q);const sx=mode==='mirror'?-1:1,sy=mode==='upside_down'||mode==='backward'?-1:1;return[cx+a[0]*sx+a[2]*.2,cy+a[1]*sy-a[2]*.15]}for(let k=0;k<2;k++){const u=p(k?[-170,170,0]:[-170,-170,0]),v=p(k?[170,-170,0]:[170,170,0]);ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(...u);ctx.lineTo(...v);ctx.lineWidth=8;ctx.strokeStyle=k?'#f4a5cb':'#ffcd81';ctx.stroke()}ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.font='bold 20px Georgia';ctx.fillStyle='#f8e9c6';ctx.fillText('THE ONE',cx,cy+6);ctx.fillText('BABEL ↑ NINE',cx,70);ctx.fillText('INFERNO ↓ NINE',cx,h-62);if(game.stageIndex===17)ctx.fillText('❄ FROZEN NINTH CIRCLE',cx,h-31);$('rotation').textContent='ECEF (0,0,0) · X '+node.angles[0].toFixed(0)+'° · Y '+node.angles[1].toFixed(0)+'° · Z '+node.angles[2].toFixed(0)+'°'}let prior=0;function frame(t){if(t-prior>85){node=U.step(node,.085);draw();prior=t}requestAnimationFrame(frame)}render();drawModules('body');cipher();draw();requestAnimationFrame(frame);
</script>
